OL,3,GNEWSAHow can we feel safe at night,
OL,4,Ateens ask police
OL,5,
OL,6,FMore needs to be done to stop young
OL,7,Fpeople using knives, despite a 20% drop
OL,8,Fin serious youth violence and
OL,9,Fknife-enabled robbery, the new chief
OL,10,Fconstable of West Midlands Police has
OL,11,Fsaid.
OL,13,FSpeaking to a group of 16 to
OL,14,F21-year-olds at The Way youth centre in
OL,15,FWolverhampton, Scott Green said tactics
OL,16,Flike stop and search, focussing on
OL,17,Fstreet robberies and being "relentless
OL,18,Fon pursuing offenders" had contributed
OL,19,Fto the fall.
OL,23,APub: 13-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
