OL,3,GNEWSAHow can we feel safe at night,
OL,4,Ateens ask police
OL,5,
OL,6,FHowever, knife crime and youth crime
OL,7,Ffigures were still too high, he said,
OL,8,Fbut cited early intervention and
OL,9,Feducation as key factors in helping
OL,10,Fyoung people not get involved.
OL,12,FHe was responding to questions such as
OL,13,Fhow young people could be sure they
OL,14,Fwould be safe in Birmingham city centre
OL,15,Fduring major events and at night.
